<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>Karun's Online Business Card</title>
    <!-- Week 6 Reset Code: Use this if you need a fresh start -->
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">
</head>
<body>

    <header>
        <h1 id="main-title">😎 Karun's Profile</h1>
        <p class="alert-text"><strong>Notice:</strong> Welcome to my online business card!</p>
    </header>

    <main>
        <div class="card">
            <img src="profile.jpg" alt="profile photo" style="max-width: 150px;">
            <h2>Karun Bishowakarma</h2>
            <p><strong>Age:</strong> 19 | <strong>Height:</strong> 5'4"</p>
            <p>I am a coding beginner exploring the world of web programming.</p>
            <p>You can send me an email below.</p>
            
            <form>
                <label for="visitor-email">Email Address:</label>
                <input type="email" id="visitor-email" placeholder="example@stu.ac.kr">
                <button type="submit">Contact Me</button>
            </form>
        </div>
    </main>

    <footer>
        <p>&copy; 2026 Karun's Portfolio</p>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>
